Draft date: 2026-10-17

FADE IN:

INT. MOUNTAIN OPERATIONS ROOM - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

COMMANDER SAVA
(serious)
The stone bridge is old, but it carries the only road wide enough for their armour.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

ENGINEER KOVAC
(measured)
I can bring it down cleanly, but I need time and an observation post to call the charges.

COMMANDER SAVA
(firm)
Hold the riverbank, secure the hill, and protect the engineers until the bridge is destroyed.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
